{"type":"text","timestamp":1795055364387,"sessionID":"ses_e0e6b598affelfgsMVF6vxqdK3","part":{"id":"prt_1f1a32477001JEI5y8r0G0ToqO","sessionID":"ses_e0e6b598affelfgsMVF6vxqdK3","messageID":"msg_1f1a2ff43001CKwUg6JEHSaQY3","type":"text","text":"## 4.1 直接課程預算（SAMPLE）\n\n| 課程 | 梯次 | 席次 | 講師費（NT$） | 教材費（NT$） | 場地/設備費（NT$） | 評量費（NT$） | 小計（NT$） |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| C-01 | 2 | 36 | 210,000 | 70,000 | 50,000 | 20,000 | 350,000 |\n| C-02 | 2 | 40 | 168,000 | 56,000 | 40,000 | 16,000 | 280,000 |\n| C-03 | 1 | 12 | 72,000 | 24,000 | 16,000 | 8,000 | 120,000 |\n| 合計 | 5 | 88 | 450,000 | 150,000 | 106,000 | 44,000 | 750,000 |\n\n算術閉合：C-01 210,000+70,000+50,000+20,000=350,000；C-02 168,000+56,000+40,000+16,000=280,000；C-03 72,000+24,000+16,000+8,000=120,000；總計 450,000+150,000+106,000+44,000=750,000（所有數值為 SAMPLE/SYNTHETIC，非實際支出或核定預算）。","time":{"start":1795055363191,"end":1795055364387}}}
